# ====================================================================
# GhostAcademia-GraphPOC: .gitignore 科技偵查專案專用過濾設定
# ====================================================================

# 1. 偵查資料集與金流情資 (避免將受害學者名單、Email Logs 原始 CSV/Excel 上傳)
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.json
!modules.json
!sentence_bert_config.json
!config.json

# 2. PyVis 互動式可視化報告 (Colab 產生的 HTML 關係圖網頁)
*.html

# 3. 機器學習 / 深度學習模型重量檔與大檔案 (PyG / BERT / PyTorch 權重)
*.pt
*.pth
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
*.safetensors
.huggingface/
huggingface/
huggingface_cache/

# 4. Jupyter Notebook & Google Colab 系統暫存
.ipynb_checkpoints
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*
.virtualenv
.env
.venv
env/
venv/

# 5. Python 標準編譯暫存
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# 6. 作業系統與 IDE 垃圾檔案 (Mac / Windows / VS Code)
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp

# 7. 偵查紀錄與日誌檔
*.log
